# Public site URL used for canonical tags, sitemap, and JSON-LD.
# Set this to the real production domain once available.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.avivafoodstuff.ae

# Optional: email delivery for the quote/contact form API route (app/api/quote/route.ts).
# Uncomment and set if you wire up a transactional email provider (Resend, SendGrid, Postmark, etc.)
# RESEND_API_KEY=

# Optional: Google Maps embed / API key for the contact page map.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
